name issue_133_pacer_v2_outage_15s
describe Video-only call, 15 s outage at 10 s: video must come back after link-up (issue #133)
# Before the fix the outage monitor paused the encoder, nothing was sent, no feedback came back and the
# video never resumed (frames_rendered 300, one 30 s pause). libwebrtc keeps the link alive with
# PacingController::ShouldSendKeepalive: a padding packet every 500 ms while the pacer is paused.
# With the fix video resumes ~0.3 s after link-up (seed 1: 15 s outage -> pause/freeze about 15.3 s).
seed 1
duration 40s
audio off
pacer v2
at 0s capacity=3000kbps delay=40ms queue=300ms
at 10s down
at 25s up
expect video.frames_rendered > 650
expect video.pause_total_ms < 16500
